                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I guess from an amateur game maker's perspective (I'm not, but the guys that made this sure are), this title isn't too bad.  However, there are a lot of things that just don't feel right.  From the combat, to jumping off walls, to the gameplay controls in general,  It almost feels like one has to get lucky just one time in order to pass certain sequences of the game because the stage wasn't put together well.  I feel like this game can serve as a good lesson for the programmers, and hopefully their next project can learn from this game's mistakes.",
